# Build context for the Dockerfile: sources and manifests only. Local installs and build output
# are excluded so the image is built from the lockfile, never from a developer's node_modules,
# and secrets (.env) and the private planning symlink never enter a layer.
# Rejected: an allow-list (`*` then `!packages`), which silently drops a new top-level file the
# build needs.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.svelte-kit
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.git
.github
.claude
.scratch
docs
*.log
.DS_Store
